# Implementation plan — Spec 1.11.0

## Summary

Spec 1.11.0 adds a standalone **Data microservice** (`data/`) owning platform reference catalog: tags, units of measure, attributes, products, services, and spaces — each with CRUD, search/filter, and server pagination. Admin SPA uses UI Kit patterns; WebOnOne gets a Data nav handoff. Deploy target: `data.webonone.com`. See [01-overview.md](./01-overview.md) through [06-platform-integration.md](./06-platform-integration.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.11.0` |
| Ports | FE :3005, BE :4005 |
| DB | `webonone_data` |
| Package builds | `build:platform-nav`, `build:theme`, `build:ui-kit` before data prod build |
| JWT | Same `JWT_SECRET` in data + identity backends |

---

## Phase 1 — Service scaffold

**Goal:** Runnable `data/` with health, auth shell, base migrations.

**Exit criteria:** `npm run dev:data` starts; `GET /health` 200.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Root workspace | `package.json` |
| Service root | `data/package.json` |
| Backend scaffold | `data/backend/src/**` (mirror `email/backend`) |
| Frontend scaffold | `data/frontend/src/**` (mirror `email/frontend`) |
| Base migration | `data/backend/migrations/*_data_base_tables.ts` |
| Nav + layout | `data/frontend/src/features/shell/**`, `AppLayout.tsx` |
| Auth callback | `data/frontend/src/features/auth/**` |
| Deploy stub | `data/deploy/IIS.md`, `web.config` |

**Verify:** `npm run migrate -w data-root` · `npm run type-check -w data-root`

---

## Phase 2 — Domain API

**Goal:** CRUD + list APIs for all six entities.

**Exit criteria:** List endpoints return `{ items, total, page, pageSize }`.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Junction migration | `data/backend/migrations/*_data_junction_tables.ts` |
| Zod schemas | `data/backend/src/schemas/*.schema.ts` |
| Services | `data/backend/src/services/*.service.ts` |
| Routes | `data/backend/src/routes/*.routes.ts` |
| Auth middleware | `requireSuperAdmin` on POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE |

**Verify:** curl/manual API smoke per entity

---

