## Cross-service integration

| Channel | Use |
|---------|-----|
| Identity redirect | Data FE login via auth code |
| JWT | Data BE verifies locally |
| WebOnOne nav | Redirect to `VITE_DATA_ORIGIN` |
| Public HTTP | Peers read `GET /api/v1/*` with user JWT (documented; no consumer impl required) |

